{
  "id": "PRO.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "PRO",
  "reference": "Proverbs 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PRO 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The proverbs of Solomon. A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish son",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the heaviness of his mother.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Treasures of wickedness profit nothing: but righteousness delivereth from death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will not suffer the soul of the righteous to famish: but he casteth away the substance of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He becometh poor that dealeth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a slack hand: but the hand of the diligent maketh rich.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that gathereth in summer",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a wise son:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "but",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that sleepeth in harvest",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a son that causeth shame.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessings",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upon the head of the just: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The memory of the just",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "blessed: but the name of the wicked shall rot.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The wise in heart will receive commandments: but a prating fool shall fall.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that walketh uprightly walketh surely: but he that perverteth his ways shall be known.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that winketh with the eye causeth sorrow: but a prating fool shall fall.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The mouth of a righteous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "man is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a well of life: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatred stirreth up strifes: but love covereth all sins.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the lips of him that hath understanding wisdom is found: but a rod",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for the back of him that is void of understanding.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lay up knowledge: but the mouth of the foolish",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "near destruction.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The rich man's wealth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his strong city: the destruction of the poor",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "their poverty.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The labour of the righteous",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "tendeth",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to life: the fruit of the wicked to sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the way of life that keepeth instruction: but he that refuseth reproof erreth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that hideth hatred",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "with",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lying lips, and he that uttereth a slander,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PRO.10.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a fool.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PRO 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the multitude of words there wanteth not sin: but he that refraineth his lips",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PRO.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PRO.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PRO.10.19",
